    "paragraph": "\"Electric Vehicle Charging Station Location Selection using Geospatial Artificial Intelligence (GeoAI)\" develops a geospatial artificial intelligence framework combining a variational autoencoder and a graph convolutional network to identify optimal charging sites. \"A Systematic Evaluation of Infrastructure-Based Radar System for Highway Traffic Monitoring\" evaluates infrastructure-based radar performance using a new dual-modality vehicle trajectory dataset validated against drone-derived ground truth. \"Critical Data Studies in the Anthropocene\" introduces the concept of the Anthropocene to critical data studies to examine the environmental impacts and extractive logics of datafication and artificial intelligence.",
